# Developer Mode: point the CLI at the Extension Host inside the Live *beta* app.
# Only ONE Live may be running: a release Live open alongside the beta silently
# disables the beta's extension subsystem (no ipc sockets, CLI fails to connect).
# Live beta → Settings → Extensions → Developer Mode ON, then `npm start`.
EXTENSION_HOST_PATH=/Applications/Ableton Live 12 Beta.app/Contents/Helpers/ExtensionHost/ExtensionHostNodeModule.node
